    "run": {
      "note": "Ω3 GATE composition. vivim.run's grant lists the host-op aliases (port:host.compartment.spawn/terminate/stats@1) BEFORE the host.compartment.admin capability they alias: the µhost's token table keys a token by the LAST alias name it registers (register() overwrites cap per key), so the admin capability must land last for ctx.port.call('host.compartment.*@1') to pass the B3 SCOPE check from inside the compartment. Same authority set as [host.compartment.admin, port:echo.ping@1] — the aliases ARE that capability, per HOST_OP_TO_CAP.",
